<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<xs:schema xmlns:fficebugfix="http://www.fixm.aero/ffice/1.1/bugfix/2024.04.30" xmlns:xs="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:fx="http://www.fixm.aero/flight/4.3" xmlns:fb="http://www.fixm.aero/base/4.3" xmlns:ffice="http://www.fixm.aero/app/ffice/1.1" targetNamespace="http://www.fixm.aero/ffice/1.1/bugfix/2024.04.30" elementFormDefault="qualified" version="2024.04.30">
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>
========
BUG FIX  
========
Two fields are missing from the FF-ICE Message Application 1.1.0 templates.
- Flight.flightRulesCategory is missing from one FF-ICE template (Flight Data Response).
- RouteTrajectoryElement.modifiedRouteItemReference is missing from three FF-ICE templates (Filing Status, Planning Status, Trial Response).
This bug fix enables implementers of the FF-ICE Message Application 1.1.0 to exchange these missing properties using the existing extension hooks.
			
